   "stem": {
      "text": "The function \\( f \\) has derivatives of all orders, and its values at \\( x = 2 \\) are \\( f(2) = 1 \\), \\( f'(2) = -3 \\), \\( f''(2) = 8 \\), \\( f'''(2) = -12 \\). Let \\( P \\) be the second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = 2 \\). Find the value of \\( P\\left(1\\right) \\)."
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
      "mathjson": 8
